  - spintronics
  - software
abstract: >-
  spinq-vqe provides PennyLane-based variational quantum eigensolver (VQE) and
  QAOA workflows for Kagome antiferromagnets and spin-orbit-torque material
  screening, with exact-diagonalization benchmarks, entanglement diagnostics,
  and reproducible notebooks.
